	<meta name="description" content="Matterhorn For Sustainable Farming
Matterhorn Agricultural Machinery is a Turkey based manufacturing company specialised in Farm Implements.
Karalar family is a farmer origin family and engaged in farm machines manufacturing in 1974. We have been manufacturing since then. 
In 2018, Bulent Karalar founded Matterhorn Agricultural Machinery Ltd. for export market and currently have 38 dealers worldwide and also have cooperate companies in Africa and South America.
Our motto is ‘ Matterhorn For Sustainable Farming’">
